{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this when the person says they paid, and to read whether a checkout is pending, paid, consumed, expired, or cancelled. If checkout_state is paid, immediately call pay_and_access or get_receipt with origin_tool and origin_arguments to deliver the tool result. The result also reports checkout_state of awaiting_payer, payment_submitted, confirming, paid, failed, or expired, and tx_hash when the payment has settled. It does not consume a unit. Pass list_origin_tools true to include available_tools and each inputSchema from the origin. When the checkout has a Pix test option, the result also includes pix.status of pending, paid, expired, or consumed. Use get_receipt without origin_tool to read a receipt for free, and cancel_checkout to invalidate an unused confirmation. Input: confirmation or offer_id. It does not pay or cancel.","icons":[{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"],"src":"https://mcp.agents.trydak.com/favicon.svg"},{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["32x32"],"src":"https://mcp.agents.trydak.com/favicon-32x32.png"},{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["180x180"],"src":"https://mcp.agents.trydak.com/apple-touch-icon.png"},{"mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["512x512"],"src":"https://mcp.agents.trydak.com/icon-512.png"},{"mimeType":"image/x-icon","sizes":["16x16","32x32"],"src":"https://mcp.agents.trydak.com/favicon.ico"}],"inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"confirmation":{"description":"Single-use confirmation from prepare_checkout. Pass this or offer_id.","maxLength":512,"type":"string"},"list_origin_tools":{"description":"Optional. When true, include available_tools from the origin. This does not consume a unit.","type":"boolean"},"offer_id":{"description":"Accepted offer id. Pass this or confirmation.","maxLength":80,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_checkout_status","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https